# 跨平台一致性:仓库统一 LF(源码/CSS/JSON 的测试断言依赖 \n),
# Windows 上 git autocrlf=true 会把工作区转成 CRLF,导致 CSS 文本断言失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件禁止任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
